# Melissa, Cursed Needle

> Melissa after patch 2.2.16 ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) is a trimmer version of the 2.1.67 rework. The blink-into-Muddles combo and the Go Away shield still define her, but her attack speed window is shorter and Muddles carries less of each auto. She remains a zone-tether DPS, only now the zone rewards earlier setup and cleaner spacing.

